cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software in your work, please cite it using the following metadata.
type: software
title: "AgentBio: an audited drug-repurposing research pipeline for rare and neglected diseases"
authors:
  - family-names: Britto
    given-names: Evan
version: benchmark-freeze-v2
date-released: 2026-08-09
license: MIT
keywords:
  - drug repurposing
  - rare diseases
  - computational biology
  - validation methodology
abstract: >-
  AgentBio is a drug-repurposing research pipeline for rare and neglected
  diseases with an independently validated audit layer. Validation results of
  record: rediscovery benchmark v2 (6/22 in-scope, all hits top-10, frozen
  2026-08-09) and audit claim-set v2 (defect recall 60/60, control false-flag
  2/40, frozen 2026-08-11). Full evidence trail, published failures, and
  rerunnable provenance verification: validation/validation_campaign_dossier.md
  and validation/verify_v2_provenance.py. Research prototype; not clinically
  validated.
